        "Body": {
          "Content": "<p><b>What&nbsp;and&nbsp;why:</b></p><p>Rolling&nbsp;out&nbsp;in&nbsp;Frontier,&nbsp;this&nbsp;skill&nbsp;reads&nbsp;the&nbsp;whole&nbsp;deck:&nbsp;slides,&nbsp;charts,&nbsp;tables&nbsp;and&nbsp;speaker&nbsp;notes,&nbsp;and&nbsp;hands&nbsp;back&nbsp;an&nbsp;impartial&nbsp;guide:&nbsp;the&nbsp;gist,&nbsp;the&nbsp;ask,&nbsp;the&nbsp;key&nbsp;takeaways,&nbsp;key&nbsp;numbers&nbsp;and&nbsp;open&nbsp;questions.</p><p>This&nbsp;experience&nbsp;can&nbsp;help&nbsp;users&nbsp;review&nbsp;and&nbsp;understand&nbsp;presentations&nbsp;more&nbsp;efficiently&nbsp;and&nbsp;identify&nbsp;information&nbsp;that&nbsp;may&nbsp;require&nbsp;further&nbsp;attention.</p><p><b>Rollout&nbsp;schedule:</b></p><p>Frontier:&nbsp;Rolling&nbsp;out&nbsp;in&nbsp;September&nbsp;2026</p><p><b>Impact&nbsp;on&nbsp;your&nbsp;organization:</b></p><p>Who&nbsp;is&nbsp;affected:</p><ul><li>Users&nbsp;with&nbsp;access&nbsp;to&nbsp;this&nbsp;feature&nbsp;in&nbsp;PowerPoint&nbsp;for&nbsp;Windows&nbsp;desktop.</li></ul><p>Platform:</p><ul><li>PowerPoint&nbsp;for&nbsp;Windows&nbsp;desktop.</li></ul><p>After&nbsp;this&nbsp;change,&nbsp;users&nbsp;can&nbsp;access&nbsp;a&nbsp;personalized&nbsp;reading&nbsp;guide&nbsp;for&nbsp;a&nbsp;presentation.&nbsp;The&nbsp;guide&nbsp;provides&nbsp;an&nbsp;impartial&nbsp;summary&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;presentation&nbsp;and&nbsp;highlights:</p><ul><li>The&nbsp;presentation’s&nbsp;main&nbsp;idea</li><li>Key&nbsp;takeaways</li><li>Important&nbsp;numbers</li><li>Relevant&nbsp;visuals</li><li>Speaker&nbsp;notes</li><li>Open&nbsp;questions</li></ul><p>This&nbsp;change&nbsp;is&nbsp;intended&nbsp;to&nbsp;help&nbsp;users&nbsp;understand&nbsp;presentation&nbsp;content&nbsp;more&nbsp;quickly.</p><p><b>Action&nbsp;required&nbsp;/&nbsp;Recommendations:</b></p><p>No&nbsp;action&nbsp;is&nbsp;required.</p><p>A&nbsp;Copilot&nbsp;license&nbsp;is&nbsp;required.</p><p>You&nbsp;may&nbsp;want&nbsp;to&nbsp;inform&nbsp;your&nbsp;users&nbsp;about&nbsp;this&nbsp;new&nbsp;experience&nbsp;and&nbsp;update&nbsp;internal&nbsp;training&nbsp;or&nbsp;support&nbsp;documentation&nbsp;as&nbsp;appropriate.</p>",
